  "question": {
    "text": "The angle of elevation of a cloud <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math> from a point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>200</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>m</mi></math> above a still take is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup></math>. If the angle of depression of the image of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math> in the lake from the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>60</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mi>C</mi></math> (in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi></math>) is equal to"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>100</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>200</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math>",
