    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0018_9869dd4701f3.png\" style=\"width: 291px; height: 281px;\" />&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>tan</mi><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>and&#160;</mtext></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>tan</mi><mn>60</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>400</mn></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mfrac></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>400</mn><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>400</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>200</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>sin</mi><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>200</mn><mi>PC</mi></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>PC</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>400</mn></math>&nbsp;</p>"
  }
